      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the civil‑rights era, African‑American activists in Washington County, including those near Elizabeth, pushed for change amid poverty and racial tension.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
